      "message": "We need to confirm not only the case to insert but also the case to eject.\n\nWhen SIM is ejected, onConfigurationChange is needed to invoke. And Mcc/Mnc\u003d0 is expected according to http://developer.android.com/reference/android/content/res/Configuration.html#mcc",
