      "writtenOn": "2014-05-15T10:36:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your explain. I have a question.\nAs you mentioned, when customer ejects SIM, onConfigurationChanged is not called.\nIt means that the configuration_changed event is not occurred.\nSo, how can the Activity know that user ejects SIM and restart the activity?\nIf the customer ejects SIM and  he/she does not insert the card anymore until power off, is some activity killed and can not be restarted on non-hot-swap device?",
      "parentUuid": "6a3700c4_a9f0fdb8",
      "revId": "73565c13d00426a01b9a709ffaec0c3d71496717",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
