      "writtenOn": "2014-05-16T01:30:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I explained, hotswap is not supported by vanilla yet.\nAnd when SIM is ejected, system will restart.\nThen it\u0027s lack of implementation to support HotSwap.\nHence onConfigurationChanged with mcc/mnc is called by inserting SIM, onConfigurationChanged with mcc/mnc\u003d0 is needed to invoke on hotswap supported device to keep consistency for application.",
